{"t":1793784152785,"lane":"1","type":"agent.say","text":"The four ferry tickets are booked and paid. You approved on the yes card, then I paid. The booking reference is **HL-GW5FEM** and the order status shows **paid**.\n\n- **Trip:** Saturday 7 Nov, return trip from Gateway of India to Elephanta Island. The ferry leaves at **09:30** and arrives at 10:30. The return leaves Elephanta at **14:00** and gets back at 15:00.\n  - 09:00 had no upper-deck seats left and 10:00 had only 2, so 09:30 was the only time between 9 and 10 that fit four.\n  - The 12:30 return would get you back at 13:30, before 14:00, so 14:00 is the earliest return that works. If you meant a boat leaving after 14:00, the next one is 15:30.\n- **Class:** Upper deck at 3.20 USDC a person, which is under your 4 USDC limit. The total was **12.80 USDC**, paid in USDC on the Arbitrum Sepolia test network, so no real money moved.\n- **Boarding:** Gateway jetty 4, the step-free one. Boarding help for Sam Okoye is on the booking at no charge.\n- **Seats:** Asha Rao U15, Leo Marin U16, Mei Tan U17, Sam Okoye U18. Each person's ID was entered as you gave it.\n- **Payment record:** transaction `0x4d85ecd4…7bd707` ([explorer](https://sepolia.arbiscan.io/tx/0x4d85ecd4a3eb1b75176206fe55d048e0e672eb8d535c02d540f0d795277bd707)).\n- **Cancellation:** free until Friday 6 Nov at 18:00. To cancel, run `./bin/ferry refund o-922f6r`. The refund goes back to the same wallet.\n\nI made one quote too many: my first wording of the boarding-help note used a pronoun for Sam, so I quoted again with neutral wording. That first quote, q-5qxgny, was never booked or paid and will simply expire."}
